#: configdialog.cpp:105
#, fuzzy, kde-kuit-format
#| msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
#| msgid ""
#| "When text or an area of the screen is highlighted with the mouse or "
#| "keyboard, this is the <emphasis>selection</emphasis>. It can be pasted "
#| "using the middle mouse button.<nl/><nl/>If the selection is explicitly "
#| "copied using a <interface>Copy</interface> or <interface>Cut</interface> "
#| "action, it is saved to the <emphasis>clipboard</emphasis>. It can be "
#| "pasted using a <interface>Paste</interface> action. <nl/><nl/>When turned "
#| "on this option keeps the selection and the clipboard the same, so that "
#| "any selection is immediately available to paste by any means. If it is "
#| "turned off, the selection may still be saved in the clipboard history "
#| "(subject to the options below), but it can only be pasted using the "
#| "middle mouse button."
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"When text or an area of the screen is highlighted with the mouse or "
"keyboard, this is the <emphasis>selection</emphasis>. It can be pasted using "
"the middle mouse button.<nl/><nl/>If the selection is explicitly copied "
"using a <interface>Copy</interface> or <interface>Cut</interface> action, it "
"is saved to the <emphasis>clipboard</emphasis>. It can be pasted using a "
"<interface>Paste</interface> action.<nl/><nl/>When turned on, this option "
"keeps the selection and the clipboard the same,  so that any selection is "
"immediately available to paste by any means. If it is turned off, the "
"selection may still be saved in the clipboard history (subject to the option "
"below), but it can only be pasted using the middle mouse button."
msgstr ""
"Tekst eller skjermområde uthevet med musa eller tastaturet kalt "
"<emphasis>utvalg</emphasis>. Du kan lime det inn med «midtknappen» på musa."
"<nl/><nl/>Hvis utvalget er kopiert med en <interface>«Kopier»</interface> "
"eller <interface>«Klipp ut»</interface>-handling, blir det lagret til "
"<emphasis>utklippstavla</emphasis>. Du kan lima det inn igjen med en "
"<interface>«Lim inn»</interface>-handling. <nl/><nl/>Når det er krysset av "
"her, er utklippstavla og utvalget automatisk synkroniserte, slik at de "
"alltid inneholder det samme, og dette innholdet kan limes inn på valgfri "
"måte. Hvis det ikke er krysset av her, kan likevel utvalget lagres i "
"utklippstavla (avhengig av valg nedenfor), men det kan bare limes inn med "
"midtknappen."

